[{"type":"message","user":"U026A3V65CJ","text":"\u003c@U026A3V65CJ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1625661781.263400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"27944190-1503-4748-92F3-10213AFD0756","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"テキストエディタってそれこそ特定の思想に集った会社という共同体でさえ作るのが難しいわけですよ。それを特定の個人と有志たちが40年もかけて作り続けていること。それをフォークしたプロジェクトが一定のシェアを持って存続し続けていることは、もはやソフトウェアの世界において奇跡と言っていいと思うんですよ。それをク○だなんてそんなバカな。","ts":"1625613140.260700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"honsore","count":10,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL","U782D5DF1","UDDCM376D","U011FTGJ3SN","UD1FQV38V","U01PMN2BVJQ","UBDMG6N2J","U01BY3SDBRS","U01PC2TUVV3"]},{"name":"chestnut","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=OJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5dc8d9c-fb58-410e-8753-bc75f33545c9","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"嫌いなもの作るくらいならマシン窓から投げ捨てて出掛けたほうがいいですねw","ts":"1625612195.254900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3oD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"450ADED2-F1BF-4D3A-B464-3664B70FC42A","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"UnixとLinuxもそうだしLinuxがいくつものディストリビュートが生まれているのも全部思想の違いだと思うんですよね。そしてプログラマって人種は思想の違うものを作り続けることに強いストレスを感じるから、思想の違うものを作りたくはない。OSSならなおさらですよね、余暇時間を割いて活動をしているんだし。","ts":"1625611994.253500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rsw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27425b97-3478-4a29-b43e-1fe3e1f3c620","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"経緯がわからない人の目にもNeovimの情報が届くようになってきてるという点はめでたい","ts":"1625611823.251000","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1625611839.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wM24"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C7CEC6DF-D0BB-4679-A33C-4672C2C484DE","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"なので共感できる思想の方を使えばいいんじゃないかなとは思うんですが。VimとNeovimのこれまでの動きを見てるからここにいる人たちはそういうもんだよねってなるんですが、これまでの経緯がわかってない人がナンデってなるのはわかる。","ts":"1625611564.246600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zxI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0BFFCAF8-5C73-48DD-939F-E6BC48D1133E","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"VimとNeovimの違いはもはや思想の違いなので、異なる思想を一つにするのは難しいのではと思うんですよね。","ts":"1625611286.243000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U026A3V65CJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bcC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aff40e44-d401-49d5-ba81-1951b919347f","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"imploved、改良し続ける意思が感じられて好き","ts":"1625585319.240700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DWx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5516beff-0c80-4a18-b114-f8b01417278d","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"もうクローン元のviとは別物になってる","ts":"1625585153.240100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s0Er"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0337a2c3-400f-4f77-9839-cc63524e0b08","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"正しい正しくないの話になったらVim自身vi imitationからvi implovedになった歴史あるもんなぁ","ts":"1625585134.239600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dVH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2786f6be-9e98-48e1-aa09-c831bd6ba3d8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"どっちかの仕様に合わせるべき\nよりも\nお互いの良いところを取り入れる\nってのが個人的に好き","ts":"1625584510.238400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS","U01H161HVPS","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BHYZ"}]}]
